WEBVTT

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:03.040
Sometimes, the world feels a little too loud.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:08.960
Noise follows you into study, work, rest, and sleep.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.960
And when everything competes for attention, focus starts to fade.

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:19.380
With Ambiancy, blend rain, fire, waves, forest, and café sounds.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:23.240
Create a space that feels calm, personal, and completely yours.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.740
Find your ambience with Ambiancy. Mix it free.
